<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cleave Skill</h1>
<p>Class and level:
</p>
<pre> Barbarian Level 35
</pre>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> cleave &lt;target&gt;
 cleave             (in a fight: your opponent)
</pre>
<p>The Barbarian pulls back a great weapon and brings it down on the enemy in 
one mighty blow. It only works with a cleaving weapon in your hand: a lucern 
hammer, halberd, battle axe, great axe, war axe, lochaber axe, bill guisarme, 
bec de corbin, great sword or claymore.
</p><p>The blow starts the fight if there wasn't one, and it hits harder the higher 
your level, and the better your constitution and strength are against your 
enemy's constitution and dexterity. Each cleave takes 50 endurance, so you need 
more than that to try. You can cleave another player only when both of you 
have signed the book of blood.
</p><p>Looking for the weapon? See <a cmd='#'>Help Pole Cleaver</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
